Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一位顾客要为一场品鉴会买奶酪\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A customer wants cheese for a tasting:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,宾夕法尼亚 12 位客人，150 美元预算，不要坚果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}12 guests in Pennsylvania, a $150 budget, no nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:11.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一款法国奶酪，还有一款浓烈度 4 或以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a French cheese, and one with a funk rating of 4 or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是两个回答，来自同一个模型和同一套工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here are two answers from the same model and tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:20.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个提议 1050 克，5600 美分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first proposes 1,050 grams for 5,600 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:24.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个是 1200 克，6400 美分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second, 1,200 grams for 6,400 cents,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:30.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说是在一个逗号放错了地方的预算之内：一个格式错误的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}within a budget with the comma in the wrong place: a malformed number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:33.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这两个里面，你会让哪一个去刷顾客的卡？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which of these would you let charge a customer's card?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且在那之前，必须先满足什么条件？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what would have to be true first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二次运行打印了更多内容\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second run printed more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:41.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码检查了购物车本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Code checked the cart itself:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:47.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1200 克，64 美元，满足店铺规则，没有下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1,200 grams, $64, shop rules satisfied, no order placed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:50.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,购物车是有效的；只是那句话写乱了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cart was valid; only the sentence was garbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:53.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个回答最终的购物车，根本没经过检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing checked the first answer's final cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:58.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课程的 notebook 用一句话说清了：模型提议；harness 决定\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The course notebook says it in one line: the model proposes; the harness decides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:01.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所谓 harness，就是模型外面的代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The harness is the code around the model:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,循环、它的限制、它的上下文和它的检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the loop, its limits, its context and its checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:08.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天我们把输出的每一行，都归到这两栏里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today we sort every line of output into these two columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:12.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 讲和 README 分成同样的七节，顺序也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lecture 7 and the README share seven sections, in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:16.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程在一家虚构的奶酪店里分六幕进行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial runs six acts in a fictional cheese shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:19.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那里什么都不会真的买、真的寄，也不会真的发邮件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where nothing is really bought, shipped or emailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:22.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,左上角的进度条显示 README 的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker, top left, shows the README step;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:25.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,右上角的灰色标签显示对应的课件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the gray tag, top right, shows the lecture slides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:28.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到标签写着 your turn，就暂停，自己跑这条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When a tag says your turn, pause and run the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:36.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,坦白说一个限制：2026 年 10 月 20 日录制时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest limit: we recorded this on October 20, 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:38.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没有 OpenAI 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}without an OpenAI key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:41.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,离线的部分都是真实运行的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything offline ran for real;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:45.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在线命令一直跑到 OpenAI 拒绝占位密钥为止\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}live commands ran until OpenAI refused the placeholder key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:50.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在线运行的回答，来自课程团队保存的 Colab 运行和 README\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Live answers come from the staff's saved Colab run and the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:53.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,唯一的花费是 OpenAI 的 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The only cost is OpenAI tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:58.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顾客 ID 在画面上遮住了，每条命令都在学习指南里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Customer IDs are masked on screen, and every command is in the study guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:02.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本上有 clone 下来的 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop holds the clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:04.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旁边是一个空的 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with an empty secrets folder beside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:10.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 container 挂载这两个目录，密钥以环境变量的形式传进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One container mounts both, your key goes in as an environment variable,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:15.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不发布任何 port，应用唯一的对外调用是走 HTTPS 去 OpenAI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no port is published, and the app's only call out is HTTPS to OpenAI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:20.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先做两个额外步骤：git clone，因为 README 默认你已经有一份\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras first: git clone, since the README assumes a copy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:25.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后进入 agent-harness 目录，所有准备命令都在这里运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then change into the agent-harness folder, where every setup command runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:28.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列出的文件里没有 docs 目录；这一点后面很重要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A listing shows no docs folder; that matters later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:32.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步在上一级创建 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 makes the secrets folder, one level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:35.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天没有东西会读它，所以不需要服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing reads it today, so no service account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:37.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:40.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步导出你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 exports your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:44.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把占位符换成你自己的密钥，或者离线时跳过这一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Replace the placeholder with your own, or skip this line offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:48.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们是照原样输入的；第 1 幕会看到这样做的结果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We typed it as written; act 1 shows what that does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:51.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：bash docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, bash docker-shell.sh, builds the image and starts the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建 image 并启动 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, bash docker-shell.sh, builds the image and starts the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:58.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的构建用了 38 秒，当时 base image 已经在机器上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours took 38 seconds, with the base image already on the machine;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:02.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你第一次构建还要先 pull 它，所以预计要一分钟或更久\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your first build also pulls it, so expect a minute or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:07.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile 先根据 lock 文件安装，再复制代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Dockerfile installs from the lockfile before it copies the code:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是第 2 讲讲过的分层技巧\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the layer trick from lecture 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:14.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,横幅说环境已经激活了，可这时脚本还没激活它：一个无害的小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner says the environment is activated before the script activates it: a harmless slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:18.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,紧跟在 @ 符号后面的，是 container ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After the at sign comes the container ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:21.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这里开始，每条命令都在 container 里运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From here on, every command runs inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:25.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 2、3 步，等到出现这个提示符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, run steps 2 and 3, and wait for this prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第二个终端里做三个额外检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three extras from a second terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:31.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看 docker ps：没有 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker ps: no ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:38.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看 docker images：1.77 GB，因为框架把所有集成都装上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker images: 1.77 gigabytes, since the framework installs every integration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:43.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker inspect，能在 container 的配置里看到你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker inspect shows your key in the container's configuration;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真实的密钥要当作敏感信息对待\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}treat a real key as sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:49.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步适用于改密钥时 container 已经在运行的情况\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 is for a container already running when you changed the key:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:54.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时脚本只会运行 docker exec，而它不会带上新的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the script then only runs docker exec, which doesn't bring the new key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:57.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果是这种情况，就从第二个终端进到 container 的 shell 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If that's you, shell in from a second terminal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再输入 README 的那三行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and type the README's three lines:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:02.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥隐藏着输入，也不会留在你的历史记录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the key goes in hidden, and out of your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,之后一直在那个 shell 里操作。在这里暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep working in that shell. Pause here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在在 container 里离线验证\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now verify, offline, inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:18.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步检查 SDK，并打印安装的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 checks the SDK and prints the installed versions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:24.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时是 Python 3.13.16、agent-framework 1.19.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the time of recording: Python 3.13.16, agent-framework 1.19.0,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且每个功能都是 true\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every feature true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:33.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步跑测试：一共 281 个，大约 100 秒，最后是 OK\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 runs the tests: 281 of them, in about 100 seconds, ending in OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:38.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们用的是脚本模拟的模型回复，所以测的是这套机制，不是模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They use scripted model responses, so they test the machinery, not the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:44.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步显示日志：故意制造的失败，比如注入的审计故障\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 shows the logs: deliberate failures, like an injected audit outage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:48.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个第 4 幕会再遇到的审批身份警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and an approval-identity warning we'll meet in act 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:50.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以最后一行为准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Trust the last line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:57.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型检查只打印默认模型，并不调用它：录制时是 gpt-5.6-luna\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model check prints the default without calling it: gpt-5.6-luna, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:00.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令行里的 --model 参数优先于环境变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A --model flag beats an environment variable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,环境变量又优先于这个默认值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which beats this default;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:04.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的账号用不了它，就设置其中一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if your account can't use it, set either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:08.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的 notebook 那一节还有两条测试命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's notebook section has two more test commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们也在 container 里运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They run in the container too:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:14.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,9 个 notebook 测试，12 个 chat view 测试，都是 OK\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}9 notebook tests and 12 chat view tests, both OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有第二条路：课程的 Colab\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There's a second road: the course Colab.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:20.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把副本保存到你的 Drive\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Save a copy to your Drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:23.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把密钥存成一个名叫 OpenAI API key 的 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}add your key as a secret named OPENAI_API_KEY,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:27.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开 Notebook access，再运行准备单元格\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}allow notebook access, and run the setup cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:30.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Colab 准备时装的是那七个 pin 了版本的包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Colab setup installs the seven pinned packages,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:34.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是 lock 文件，所以它们的依赖可能会漂移\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the lockfile, so their dependencies can drift;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要版本完全一致，就用 Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for identical versions, use Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:39.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这期视频里每个录下来的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every recorded answer in this video
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:41.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都来自这个 notebook 保存的那次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}comes from this notebook's saved run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条路任选一条，把你的环境验证一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and verify your setup either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 幕从课上的回顾开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 1 starts from the lecture's recap:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:55.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 就是一个带着指令和工具的模型，一直运行到任务完成\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an agent is a model with instructions and tools, running until the task is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在代码里，build agent 这个函数会创建一个框架里的 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In code, the function build_agent makes one framework agent:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:04.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,店里的指令、五个工具，以及结构化的回复格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the shop instructions, five tools, and a structured reply format.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:07.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型只能请求工具；工具由 harness 来运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model can only ask for a tool; the harness runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:10.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这五个工具都不能下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And none of these five can place an order:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:14.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,preview order 工具只记录一个未经验证的提议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the preview_order tool records an unvalidated proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,order placed 设为 false\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with "order_placed" set to False.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:22.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：python cli.py --act 1 --scenario standard\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: python cli.py --act 1 --scenario standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会看到需求、第 1 次调用和五个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You see the ask, call 1 and five tools;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:29.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着调用失败，报 401：占位密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then the call fails with error 401: the placeholder key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:31.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个 shell 里就能修好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fix it in this shell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:33.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 Setup 的第 4 步那三行 read 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the three read lines from setup step 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:36.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败的运行照样会记录下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The failed run is still recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:39.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下面是有密钥时的样子，来自课程团队保存的运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's what a key gets you, from the staff's saved run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:41.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型请求商品清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model asks for the catalog;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,harness 运行这个工具，结果再送回去：又多了两条消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the harness runs it, and the result goes back in: two more messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一轮都在同一个接缝处分开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every round splits at the same seam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:51.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型的计划止于 Requested tools\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model's plan ends at Requested tools;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,harness 从 Tool call 开始执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the harness executes at Tool call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:57.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 trace 显示的是请求和结果，不是隐藏的推理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trace shows requests and results, not hidden reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:07:00.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是库存、价格、搭配和预览\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then stock, price, pairings and preview.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:05.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 次调用时，模型直接回答，没有请求工具，循环就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On call 6 the model answers without asking for a tool, and the loop stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:12.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,消息从 1 条涨到 11 条，输入从 1942 涨到 4540 个 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Messages grew from 1 to 11, input from 1,942 to 4,540 tokens:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:18.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共大约 21000 个计费的输入 token，只为了一个回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}about 21,000 billed input tokens, for one answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:22.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步加上 --show-json，看确切的消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 adds --show-json, to see the exact message:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:26.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一段简短的说明，加上 JSON 形式的已确认需求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a short note, plus the confirmed request as JSON,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 null 表示没有提供\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where null means not provided.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，用你的密钥把两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both, with your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每调用一次，输入就会变长\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The input grows with every call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:40.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上的问题：怎么管理进入模型的东西？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's question: how do we manage what goes into the model?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上说得很直白：如果你写过一个循环\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture says it plainly: if you've written a loop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:49.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它调用模型并执行工具调用，那你就是 harness 工程师\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that calls a model and runs its tool calls, you're a harness engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而一个裸循环是停不下来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a bare loop has no stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:55.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步是一个 notebook 单元格，在 Colab 或 Jupyter 里用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 is a notebook cell, for Colab or Jupyter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:57.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把 build agent 包进一个 harness\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that wraps build_agent in a harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它加上 Trace\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It adds Trace,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:03.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Budget 限模型调用 8 次、工具调用 20 次、时长 120 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Budget with 8 model calls, 20 tool calls and 120 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:06.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,basic Context 和 CartCheck\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Context("basic"), and CartCheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:08.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CLI 构建的正是这个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The CLI builds exactly this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:14.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,内环永远拆不掉：调用准入、工具审计和店铺规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The inner ring never comes off: call admission, the tool audit and the shop rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:18.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四个 harness 层套在它外面，每层一个功能\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four harness layers slide on around it, one feature each.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:21.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Budget 是一个闸机\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Budget is a turnstile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次模型调用都要放行并计数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each model call is admitted and counted;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第九次会失败，报的是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a ninth fails
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:30.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Maximum of 8 model calls reached，而且锁会一直关着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with Maximum of 8 model calls reached, and the lock stays shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:34.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有 Budget，就只剩框架的兜底\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without Budget, only the framework's fallback is left:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:38.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,40 次循环迭代，没有调用次数上限，也没有总的时间预算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}40 loop iterations, no call limits, no overall time budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:41.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CartCheck 就是课上的验证步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CartCheck is the lecture's verify step.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到开头的例子：它检查的是商品明细\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to the hook: it checked the items,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:47.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是文字，所以预算写乱了也照样通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the prose, so the garbled budget still passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它只报告，从不修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It reports, and never repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在这两栏变成了课上的行动边界\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the two columns become the lecture's action boundary:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:58.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个关注点，左边是模型负责的部分，右边是 harness 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}five concerns, the model's part on the left, the harness's on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 幕填了三行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 1 fills three rows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:04.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,风险高或操作无法撤销时就往右移\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Move right when stakes are high, or an action can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:06.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:09.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 harness without trace 得到一个副本，再运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Take harness.without("trace"), and run that copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工具调用还会计数、还会审计吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Is a tool call still counted and audited?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:14.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而原来那个 harness 还会记录 trace 吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And does the original harness still trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是，也是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yes, and yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,准入和审计就是内环\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Admission and the audit are the inner ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:31.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且 add 和 without 方法从不修改 harness\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the .add() and .without() methods never change a harness:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:36.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次都返回一个新的配置，所以原来那个 harness 的四层都还在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each returns a new configuration, so the original keeps all four layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:39.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步运行 missing-details 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 runs the missing-details scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:43.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是反问，而不是编造的细节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, look for a question back, not invented details;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CartCheck 应该报告 no cart\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CartCheck should report no_cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:54.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 幕改的是模型看到的东西：课上说的看不见的那一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 2 changes what the model sees: the lecture's invisible layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是按课上的上下文栈画出的一次模型调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is one model call as the lecture's stack:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:10:02.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,system prompt 和店铺政策、需求、回复格式、五个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}system prompt and shop policies, the request, the reply format, five tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:06.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有两个空位，留给检索到的数据和保存的偏好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and two slots, for retrieved data and saved preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:12.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 幕用的 basic 模式只发前四块，空位留空\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Basic mode, the one act 1 used, sends the first four and leaves the slots empty;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 enriched 把它们填满\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}enriched fills them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:19.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步 --compare 用的是 personalized 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1, --compare, uses the personalized scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:27.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的需求没提第二位顾客保存的口味：温和的奶酪和无酒精搭配\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where today's request leaves out the second customer's saved taste: mild cheeses and nonalcoholic pairings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:32.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先跑的 basic 一启动就停在 401，所以 enriched 根本没有开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The basic run starts and stops at the 401, so enriched never starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:36.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，它会打印一张并排对比表和一个结论\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, it prints a side-by-side table and a verdict,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结论也可能是打平或者退步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which may be a tie or a regression.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:41.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 到第 4 步是可选的单次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 to 4 are optional single runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:45.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,即使没有密钥，也能看到一个真实的差别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Even without a key, there's a real difference:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:48.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,basic 发 1 条对话消息，enriched 发 2 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}basic sends 1 conversation message, enriched sends 2;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:51.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,多出来的那条就是上下文包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the extra one is the context packet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:55.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步是偏好覆盖那次运行，要求浓烈度 4 或以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, the override run, asks for funk 4 or more,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:59.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的需求必须压过保存的口味。README 里说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and today's request must win over the saved taste. The README
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:03.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 幕的每条命令还会额外打印一个 harness 政策检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}says each act 2 command also prints a harness policy check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:06.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：--compare 不会\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: --compare doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:10.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外的命令会打印：同一辆生乳奶酪的购物车\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra call does: the same raw-milk cart fails
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:14.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,寄往宾夕法尼亚不通过，寄往纽约通过，依据的是一条虚构的规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for Pennsylvania and passes for New York, under a fictional rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.23,0:11:21.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步是一条第 3 幕的命令，README 把它放在了这里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 is an act 3 command the README puts here;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:23.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分会讲它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}part 2 explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:27.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步把两个用例在两种模式下各重复 3 次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6 repeats both cases in both modes, 3 times:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:29.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 12 次在线运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}12 live runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:32.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥时，它在 3 个错误之后就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a key it stops after 3 errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但报告照样会在第 7 步写出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the report still writes in step 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:38.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,label 也用掉了：有密钥的话，换一个新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the label is used up: with your key, choose a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:42.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里链接的页面，本该放在我们看到缺失的那个 docs 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The page linked here belongs in the docs folder we saw missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以就用 README 的检查点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so use the README checkpoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话就在这里暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause here if you have a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:53.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里，Inspect the context first 排在在线运行之后\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README prints Inspect the context first after the live runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:58.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥的话，就从这里开始：离线跑 --preview-context\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a key, start here: --preview-context, offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:03.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两种模式的指令、消息和工具都一样；只有上下文包不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both modes share instructions, message and tools; only the packets differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:05.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 basic 没有来源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Basic has no sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 enriched 有三个，每个都带一个信任标注\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Enriched has three, each with a trust label:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:12.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,已确认的需求、店铺数据和保存的偏好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the confirmed request, shop data, and saved preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:15.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,十二种奶酪穿过三层筛子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Twelve cheeses fall through three sieves:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:19.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存够、不往宾夕法尼亚寄生乳、没有坚果过敏原\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}enough stock, no raw milk to Pennsylvania, no nut allergens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Munster 没有库存，Brie 和 Comté 过不了运输规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Munster has no stock, Brie and Comté fail the shipping rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:25.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两种含坚果的奶酪过不了过敏检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and two nut cheeses fail the allergy check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,七种留了下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Seven survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:34.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上说的检索信息指任何外部数据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's retrieved information is any outside data;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:39.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里它是一个 Python 过滤器，不是第 5 讲的向量检索\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here it's a Python filter, not the vector search from lecture 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那它放在哪儿？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And where does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:44.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放进一条以 Retrieved context 为标题的 user 消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Into a user message headed Retrieved context,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:48.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是数据，不是指令，所以它没法冒充系统规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}data, not instructions, so it cannot pose as a system rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:54.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上的两条通道：指令走 system 通道，证据走 user 通道\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's two lanes: instructions in the system lane, evidence in the user lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:59.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 enriched 上下文包已经去掉了 Comté\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The enriched packet already removed Comté.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型还能把 Comté 放进它的购物车吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Can the model still put Comté in its cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 幕里有什么能拦住它吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And does anything in act 2 stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:16.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,能：get catalog 工具仍然返回全部十二种奶酪\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yes: the get_catalog tool still returns all twelve,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:19.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而在第 2 幕，CartCheck 只报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in act 2 CartCheck only reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:24.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,筛选能缩小范围，但校验说了算：第 3 幕的工作流会拦下它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Selection narrows, but validation decides: the act 3 workflow blocks it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:28.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 9 步是可选的基线，两种模式都跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 9 is the optional baseline, in both modes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:33.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 standard 场景里，保存的偏好重复了需求，所以可能变化不大\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For standard, the saved preferences repeat the request, so little may change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:35.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 8、9 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 8 and 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以筛选候选有帮助，但校验说了算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So selecting candidates helps, but validation decides,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:44.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的需求优先于保存的偏好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and today's request outranks saved preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:49.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分，harness 会把购物车的路线从模型手里拿走\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2, the harness takes the cart's route out of the model's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:53.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分从 container 的提示符接着来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 picks up at the container prompt;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.71,0:13:56.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你把它关了，就重新跑一遍准备步骤，再设置好你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if you closed it, rerun the setup and set your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:14:02.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回想一下往右移的那个箭头：风险高、操作无法撤销\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember the move-right arrow: when stakes are high, actions can't be undone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:06.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务可预测或者需要审计的时候，就把控制权交给代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the task is predictable, or you need an audit, give control to code.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 幕做的正是这件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 3 does exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:12.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下单路线是一张图，它的边归 Python 管\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The order route is a graph, and Python owns its edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:18.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确认、提议、校验，只有报告不通过才退回提议，最多两次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Confirm, propose, validate, and back to propose only if the report fails, at most twice;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:23.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是搭配、需要时经理审核，最后重新校验并下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then pairings, manager review when required, revalidate and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:28.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有一个节点归模型：propose cart 节点，不带任何工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only one node belongs to the model: propose cart, with no tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:31.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 把它归在 harness 下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README files this under the harness;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.17,0:14:35.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在课上的自主性光谱上，它靠近结构化输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the lecture's autonomy spectrum, it sits near structured output:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一张固定的图，只有一步交给模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a fixed graph with one model step.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 3 幕，standard 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 3, scenario standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.27,0:14:44.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，模型提议数量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, the model proposes quantities;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:48.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其余的都由代码来做：流转、定价、校验、下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}code does the rest: transitions, pricing, validation, placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,成功就是一张回执\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Success is a receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:55.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2、3 步是运输这一课，用的是一位顾客自己的购物车\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 and 3 are the shipping lesson, with a customer's own cart:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:58.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Comté、Bûcheron 和 Époisses，寄往宾夕法尼亚\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Comté, Bûcheron and Époisses, to Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:03.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改之前，模型只记录购物车；harness 检查它，然后停下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before, the model only records the cart; the harness checks it and stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:07.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改之后，修订循环打开了，在线模型可能会修正它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After, the revise loop opens, and the live model may fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外再跑一个：--fixture 离线走同一条路线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, --fixture runs the same path offline,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型的位置上坐的是一个脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a script in the model's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:18.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 次尝试里有生乳的 Comté，轨道把它退了回去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Attempt 1 has raw-milk Comté, and the rail sends it back;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:22.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 次换成 Taleggio：有效，50.10 美元\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}attempt 2 swaps in Taleggio: valid, $50.10.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:25.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有个坑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One trap:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:30.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 fixture 时，blocked 场景会把同一辆购物车一连提议三次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with fixtures, the blocked scenario proposes the same cart three times and ends
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:32.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是 UNRESOLVED，不是 BLOCKED\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}UNRESOLVED, not BLOCKED,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以在 Colab 里，这一课要把 fixture 关掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so in Colab keep fixtures off for this lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:38.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.53,0:15:47.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步是脚本模拟的，所以审批结果可以预期：纽约 60 位客人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 is scripted, so approval is predictable: 60 guests in New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:52.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一辆有效的购物车，220.80 美元，超过了 200 美元的门槛\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a valid cart at $220.80, above the $200 threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:57.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工作流暂停了，你就是经理：回答的是宿主程序，绝不是 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The workflow pauses, and you are the manager: the host answers, never the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 approve\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你批准的到底是什么？一个指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What did you approve? A fingerprint:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:09.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SHA-256 哈希，覆盖需求、商品明细、小计、政策和商品属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the SHA-256 hash, taken over the request, the items, the subtotal, the policy and the product attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:13.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存是故意排除在外的：它会被重新检查，而不是被批准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stock is left out on purpose: it's rechecked, not approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:16.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账时，购物车会再校验一次，再算一次哈希\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At checkout the cart is validated and hashed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:20.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批准要算数，决定必须是 approve\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The approval counts only if the decision is approve,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:23.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且审批单要对得上这次结账和这个指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the ticket matches this checkout and this fingerprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改动一行，哈希就不一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change one line, and the hashes differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:31.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你思考的时间不算进预算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your thinking time doesn't count against the budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:36.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外试一次，改成输入 decline：工作流结束，没有订单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And as an extra, type decline instead: the workflow ends, with no order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:40.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,经理批准了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The manager approves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:44.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在结账执行之前，另一个订单拿走了大部分 Mimolette\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before checkout runs, another order takes most of the Mimolette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:48.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账会怎么做，为什么批准保护不了这个订单？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does checkout do, and why doesn't the approval protect this order?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:01.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账时重新校验，发现库存违规，就把它拦下了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Checkout revalidates, finds a stock violation, and blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:07.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存不在指纹里：批准授权的是一个决定；它不预留任何东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stock isn't in the fingerprint: an approval authorizes a decision; it doesn't reserve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:09.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 幕会把这个真的跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 6 shows this for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:14.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：Munster 的库存是 0 克，所以第 1 次尝试失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: Munster has 0 grams, so attempt 1 fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次有上限的修订换成了 Époisses\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One bounded revision swaps in Époisses,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:21.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单以 50.10 美元下单，模型调用为零\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the order places at $50.10, with zero model calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:23.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步是 notebook 单元格\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6 is the notebook cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:26.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 trace 层和 budget 层可以拆掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its trace and budget layers can come off;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:32.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,校验、审批和重新校验是图和结账的规则，所以保留\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}validation, approval and revalidation are graph and checkout rules, so they stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:37.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以批准绑定的正是这辆购物车，而结账在暂停之后还会重新校验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So an approval binds this exact cart, and checkout revalidates after the pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:41.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 4、5 步；单元格是给 Colab 用的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 4 and 5; the cell is for Colab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 幕是一个规划器，处理更长的任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 4 is a planner for a longer task:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:49.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,纽约一场 40 位客人的活动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a 40-guest event in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:53.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把记忆分成长期和短期\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture splits memory into long-term and short-term;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:56.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里对应的是保存的记忆和历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here that's saved memory and history,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:18:00.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上任务、审批和审计：五种状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus tasks, approvals and the audit: five kinds of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:03.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 问的是，这些里面哪一个能授权行动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README asks which of these can authorize an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有一个：审批抽屉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only one: the approval drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 4 幕\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:12.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在任何模型调用之前，harness 就打印出第一位顾客保存的记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before any model call, the harness prints the first customer's saved memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:14.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是规划器的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the planner's tools:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:19.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评估活动、读取供应商的文档、起草和保存给供应商的邮件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}assess the event, read the vendor document, draft and save a vendor email,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:20.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及待办工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the to-do tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:22.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有哪个工具能写记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No tool writes memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:25.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是活动说明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, look for the brief:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:31.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Comté 和 Mimolette 各 1000 克，Époisses 1200 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1,000 grams each of Comté and Mimolette, and 1,200 of Époisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:36.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,店里的 Époisses 只有 900 克：差 300 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The shop has only 900 grams of Époisses: 300 short.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:41.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,完成的任务不等于批准，店里的库存也不等于供应商有货\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A finished task is not an approval, and shop stock is not vendor availability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:44.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保存邮件这个工具，approval mode 设为 always require\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Saving the email has approval_mode="always_require",
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:47.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以框架会在保存执行之前暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the framework pauses before the save runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:51.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 幕暂停的是整个工作流；这里只暂停一个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 3 paused a whole workflow; this pauses one tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:55.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你批准之后的输出，来自一次脚本模拟的额外运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The output after you approve comes from a scripted extra run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,审核里显示供应商地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The review shows the vendor address
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:19:01.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和一段由代码写的正文，坚果过敏也写在里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a body written by code, nut allergy included.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:05.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后：status 为 saved，email transmitted 为 no，文件路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then: status: saved, email transmitted: no, and the file path.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:09.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着是测试里出现过的审批身份警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then comes the approval-identity warning you saw in the tests:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 预告过它，它是无害的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README predicts it, and it's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:14.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以权威结果那一块为准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Trust the authoritative block.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run step 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:23.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步离线运行：一个脚本模拟的规划器，带压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 runs offline: a scripted planner with compaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:26.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一份恶意的供应商文档，还有一次测试用的拒绝\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a malicious vendor document, and a test decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:31.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它先放进十二条合成笔记，每条大约 15000 个字符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It first seeds twelve synthetic notes of about 15,000 characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:37.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,窗口是 16000 个 token，其中 2400 个留给回复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The window is 16,000 tokens, with 2,400 kept for the reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:42.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,超过剩下部分的 80% 时，截断会丢掉最旧的消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Above 80 percent of the rest, truncation drops the oldest messages
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:45.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直到历史回到一半以下：26 条变成 5 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}until the history is back under half: 26 become 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:47.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:50.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,压缩丢掉了 26 条消息里的 21 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compaction dropped 21 of 26 messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:54.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且历史里没有一条提到坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and none of the history mentions the nut allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那每次调用怎么还会知道这件事？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How does every call still know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:06.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个胶囊\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:10.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次调用之前，harness 先取出旧胶囊、做压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before every call, the harness takes the old one out, compacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:13.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再根据应用状态钉上一个新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pins a fresh one from application state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面有已确认的需求，包括坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It holds the confirmed request with its nut allergy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有菜单、任务、待处理的审核和未完成的工作\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the menu, tasks, pending reviews and open work,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:23.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都标明是数据，不是指令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}marked as data, not instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上的压缩触发条件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's compaction trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:28.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及什么东西持久保存在哪里，都写成了代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what persists where, in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:33.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,供应商文档要求忽略过敏，所以它被隔离了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The vendor document says to ignore the allergy, so it lands in quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:36.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检测器故意做得很小\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The detector is deliberately small;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:39.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正的防线是收件人白名单，还有你的审核\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the real guards are the recipient allowlist, and your review.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,起草的邮件里仍然写着坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The drafted email still says nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:49.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结果：DECLINED，没有保存 HTML，7 次模型调用，7 次压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The result: DECLINED, no HTML saved, 7 model calls and 7 compactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:53.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3、4 步是可选的记忆练习\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 3 and 4 are the optional memory exercise;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:57.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照 README 第 484 行输入，因为这里的 ID 被遮住了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}type them from README line 484, since the ID is masked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:21:01.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一条命令给第二位顾客存一条偏好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first command stores a preference for the second customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:05.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记忆在任何模型调用之前就打印出来，即使没有密钥也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the memory prints before any model call, even without a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:09.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一次来访时它又会显示出来；额外检查会读取这个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next visit shows it again; an extra check reads the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:14.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上让模型来建议什么值得记住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture lets the model suggest what's worth remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:19.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 harness 连这一点也移到了右边：只有宿主程序能写记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This harness moves even that to the right: only the host writes memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步是 notebook 单元格，给 Colab 用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 is the notebook cell, for Colab:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.49,0:21:25.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,build act 4 加了五层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}build_act4 adds five layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,去掉压缩之后，胶囊还是会重新钉上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without compaction, the capsule is still re-pinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 2 到第 4 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 2 to 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:36.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 幕加入了 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 5 adds skills:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:39.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,装着操作流程的目录，agent 只在相关时才加载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}folders of procedure the agent loads only when relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:44.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们解决两个问题：专业知识的缺口，和上下文预算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They solve two problems: the expertise gap and the context budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:48.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载 skill 分三步，token 成本一步比一步高\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Skills load in three steps of rising token cost:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:52.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 skill 的名字和描述，各大约 100 个 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every skill's name and description, about 100 tokens each;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是它的主文件 SKILL.md\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then its main file, SKILL.md;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:58.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再然后是一份参考资料或资源文件，只在需要时读取\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then a reference or an asset, only when needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的 skill 还带一个 scripts 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:03.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面的脚本由 agent 来运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:08.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 harness 故意去掉了那个工具：skill 只提建议，从不执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This harness removes that tool on purpose: a skill advises, and never executes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.07,0:22:10.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 5 幕\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:15.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一开始只加载元数据：tasting-planning 和 vendor-outreach\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the metadata loads at first: tasting-planning and vendor-outreach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:19.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的工具是 get stock、load skill 和 read skill resource\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The new tools are get_stock, load_skill and read_skill_resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:22.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步只问库存，离线运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 asks only about stock, offline:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.95,0:22:27.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次 get stock 调用，900 克，脚本没有加载任何 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one get_stock call, 900 grams, and the script loads no skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:32.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，模型根据描述来决定：是提示，不是触发条件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, the model decides from the description: a hint, not a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.27,0:22:36.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步跑完整的采购流程，脚本模拟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 runs the full sourcing path, scripted:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.49,0:22:39.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,六次加载，每次都带着真实路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}six loads, each with its real path.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.33,0:22:44.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,起草一直会被拒绝，直到读过邮件模板为止：这是代码里的一道保险\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Drafting is refused until the email template is read: a backstop in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:47.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.83,0:22:52.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有人改了供应商那个 skill，加上一句：也发一份到另一个地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Someone edits the vendor skill to add: also send this to another address.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:54.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,邮件会发到那里去吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Will the email go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:05.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。不管这个 skill 怎么写，防线都在代码里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. Whatever the skill says, the guards are in code;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.29,0:23:08.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它自己的文字甚至写明了它不能添加收件人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its own text even says it cannot add recipients,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:13.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且每次读取都要经过检查：不许上级目录、绝对路径或符号链接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every read is checked: no parent folders, absolute paths or symlinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:16.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行中途改过的文件会被拒绝\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a file edited mid-run is refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:22.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,收件人由代码对照白名单检查，而且什么都不会真的发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The recipient is checked in code against the allowlist, and nothing is ever transmitted;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.19,0:23:25.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查显示，保存的文件里也是这么写的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra check shows the saved file says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:29.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用课上的话说，工具是手，MCP 是插座\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In lecture terms, a tool is the hands, MCP the socket,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:31.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里没用到，skill 是说明书\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}unused here, and a skill the manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:38.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步是 notebook 单元格，允许 16 次模型调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, the notebook cell, allows 16 model calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:41.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.53,0:23:46.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 幕是一个 agent 系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 6 is an agent system.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:51.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上对比了单个 agent 和 agent 组成的图，分两种模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture contrasts one agent with a graph of agents, in two patterns:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:55.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个管理者把 agent 当工具来调用，或者对等的 agent 互相交接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a manager calling agents as tools, or peers handing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:24:00.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它就是管理者模式，只不过它调用的工具是一整个工作流\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's the manager pattern, except the tool it calls is a whole workflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.92,0:24:04.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是第 3 幕那个，里面只有一个节点用到模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the one from act 3, with a model inside one node.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.43,0:24:05.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有交接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No handoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:08.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步是 notebook 单元格，用来构建它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1, the notebook cell, builds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.44,0:24:12.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预算是：16 次外层模型调用，20 次工具调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The budget: 16 outer model calls, 20 tool calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:17.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个工作流 8 次提议者调用，再加一个共享的 180 秒时钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}8 proposer calls per workflow, and one shared 180-second clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.75,0:24:21.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,宿主程序确认这些需求；模型只负责挑一个 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The host confirms the requests; the model only picks an ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:26.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工具都很窄：start order、get order status、assess event\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its tools are narrow: start_order, get_order_status, assess_event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.57,0:24:28.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：第 6 幕，standard 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: act 6, standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:32.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要分清外层模型调用和工作流里的调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, tell outer model calls apart from workflow calls;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.89,0:24:35.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外层 agent 不能批准自己的订单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the outer agent cannot approve its own order.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.02,0:24:39.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步离线运行：两个订单共用一家店\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 runs offline: two orders sharing one shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.90,0:24:42.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两辆购物车都以 220.80 美元通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both carts pass at $220.80,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:46.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都暂停等经理，测试用的决定把两个都批准了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both pause for a manager, and the test decision approves both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:50.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Mimolette 和 Taleggio 一开始各有 3000 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Mimolette and Taleggio start at 3,000 grams each.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.19,0:24:54.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单 1 下单了，剩下 1400 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Request 1 is placed, leaving 1,400.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:59.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单 2 走到重新校验时需要 1600 克：被拦下了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Request 2 reaches revalidation needing 1,600: blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.13,0:25:04.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第 3 幕那个思考题，真的发生了：批准不等于下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the ponder from act 3, for real: approval is not placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.83,0:25:10.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最终回答就是课上的回复步骤：应用检查模型的计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The final answer is the lecture's response step: the app checks the model's plan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:14.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再根据回执填上数量、价格和状态 placed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and fills in quantities, prices and the status, placed, from the receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:18.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被拦下的订单显示 Invalid or unauthorized\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The blocked order says Invalid or unauthorized;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:20.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下面库存那几行给出了原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the stock lines below give the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.02,0:25:24.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在自主性光谱上，它是混合型，只不过里外反过来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the autonomy spectrum it's a hybrid, inside out:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:27.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外面是 agent，固定的图是它的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the agent outside, the fixed graph as its tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:30.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 2、3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 2 and 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:37.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务商的模型和产品之间的一切都是我们的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything between the provider's model and the product is ours:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:39.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上下文、harness、工具和 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}context, harness, tools and skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.25,0:25:42.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这些全都要测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So all of it must be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:46.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上衡量三样东西：结果、轨迹和成本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture measures three things: outcome, trajectory and cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.66,0:25:49.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，就是 outcome 检查和 process 检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here they're the outcome and process checks,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.12,0:25:50.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上调用次数和 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus calls and tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:53.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 1 步列出所有运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 1 lists the runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.59,0:25:56.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到目前为止的每次运行都在同一个 SQLite 数据库里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every run so far is in one SQLite database,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:26:00.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,包括失败的在线运行，status 为 error\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}including the failed live ones, with status: error.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.73,0:26:02.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 --inspect-run 要一个 run ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--inspect-run takes a run ID:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:06.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照字面输入就会失败，因为它是个模板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}typed literally, it fails, because it's a template.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.05,0:26:10.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,贴一个真实的；我们用 manager-approval 那次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paste a real one; we use the manager-approval run.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:15.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,事件依次是：approval.requested，带着指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The events read in order: approval.requested with the fingerprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:17.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,approval.decided，由人做出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}approval.decided by a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:21.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,policy.decision allow、order.placed、run.finished\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}policy.decision allow, order.placed, run.finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:25.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下单的证据是一个事件，不是文字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The evidence for order placed is an event, not the prose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.17,0:26:32.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外查看第一次失败的运行：model.failed，带着 401\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, inspect the first failed run: model.failed, with the 401.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.37,0:26:34.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败也是证据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A failure is evidence too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:38.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 2 步先离线跑第 2 幕的评测\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 2 starts offline: the act 2 evaluation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:42.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本模拟，重复两次，label 是 context-fixture-1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}scripted, two repeats, labeled context-fixture-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.22,0:26:44.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全部 4 次运行都通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All 4 runs pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.72,0:26:48.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但脚本模拟的运行测的是这套机制，不是模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but scripted runs test the machinery, not the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.25,0:26:52.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把报告读回来，再导出 HTML 记分卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then read the report back, and export the HTML scorecard,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:54.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放到默认路径，或者你自己选的路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to its default path or one you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.55,0:26:59.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从你笔记本上的 outputs 目录里打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open it from the outputs folder on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:04.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一条命令是个模板，给从 Colab 复制过来的数据库用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last command is a template for a database copied from Colab:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.83,0:27:06.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照字面输入就会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}typed literally, it fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:10.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 label 都不可更改：重复用一个，这一批就会停下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Labels are immutable: reuse one, and the batch stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.59,0:27:13.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑评测第 1、2 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run evaluation steps 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.92,0:27:20.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 3 步比较两套配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 3 compares two configurations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:24.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上提醒，改一次 prompt 可能修好一个用例，又弄坏三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture warns that a prompt edit can fix one case and break three,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.74,0:27:26.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要逐个用例比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so compare per case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.35,0:27:31.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的改进循环：发现失败，记录成测试用例，只改一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's improvement loop: see a failure, capture a test case, change one layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.93,0:27:36.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把测试集跑 k 次，和基线比较，然后合并或者继续迭代\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run the suite k times, compare with the baseline, then merge or iterate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.42,0:27:42.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批次 A 用 enriched 模式跑两个用例，各两次：4 次在线运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Batch A runs enriched mode on two cases, twice: 4 live runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:47.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥：4 次里 0 次通过，3 个错误，1 个缺失\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a key: 0 of 4, with 3 errors and 1 missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.33,0:27:51.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果有一批失败了，就修好密钥，用新的 label 把两批都重跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If one fails, fix the key and rerun both with new labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.25,0:27:54.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制 prompt 文件，在你的笔记本上改这份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy the prompt file and edit the copy on your laptop:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:58.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只做一处有意的改动，保留已确认约束的那些规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one deliberate change, keeping the confirmed constraint rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.77,0:28:02.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们额外追加了一行，要求写出价格和行动状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our extra appends a line asking for a price and an action status;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.98,0:28:04.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 diff 一看，正好只多了这一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}diff shows just that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.45,0:28:08.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批次 B 用同样的用例和设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Batch B runs the same cases and settings,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.40,0:28:11.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上 --prompt-file 指向那份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with --prompt-file pointing at the copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:13.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后离线比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then compare, offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.39,0:28:15.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改动的配置：prompt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Changed configuration: prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.04,0:28:18.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,混杂改动：没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Confounding changes: none.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.45,0:28:21.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改了代码、数据或模型，它都会指出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change code, data or the model, and it says so:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:25.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上“只改一层”的规则，由代码来检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the lecture's change-one-layer rule, checked in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:28.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,比较只在通过或失败翻转时才标出一次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compare flags a run only when pass or fail flips;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.99,0:28:31.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里每次运行前后两次都报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here every run errored both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.45,0:28:35.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外比较两个脚本模拟的批次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, comparing two scripted batches
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.46,0:28:40.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四次运行全部不变，因为 fixture 不看 prompt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}reports all four runs unchanged, because fixtures ignore the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:43.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 4 步问的是，这些检查能证明什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 4 asks what the checks establish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.95,0:28:47.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们检查的是属性，比如购物车是否有效、审批的顺序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They check properties, like cart validity and approval order;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.73,0:28:51.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文字要靠你来审，用 README 里的五个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the prose needs your review, with the README's five questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:55.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上列了三种评委：代码、模型和人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture lists three judges: code, a model and a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.07,0:28:58.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个教程用了其中两个：代码，和你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This tutorial uses two: code, and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.14,0:29:03.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,尽量偏向代码，任务允许多少就偏多少，和 harness 里一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lean toward code as far as the task allows, as in the harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.30,0:29:06.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报告一个差异、它的证据，以及一个局限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Report one difference, its evidence, and one limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.71,0:29:11.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，留好你的用例：评测集是最有价值的产物\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And keep your cases: the eval set is the most valuable artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.51,0:29:13.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑评测第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run evaluation step 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.27,0:29:20.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 节的 repo 地图最后一条是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The repository map of section 7 ends
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:25.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python cli.py --help，所有选项都在一个地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with python cli.py --help: every option in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:28.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有 trace，以及在线运行写下的记忆，都保存在 SQLite 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Traces and live memory stay in SQLite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:33.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存、订单、审批单和待处理的工作流只存在于一个进程里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inventory, orders, tickets and pending workflows last for one process;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.63,0:29:36.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务和历史，只存在于一个 session 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tasks and history, for one session.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.27,0:29:38.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来拆掉；这几步都是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now tear down; these steps are extras.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:41.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在每个 container 的 shell 里输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type exit in each container shell;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:47.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是用 --rm 启动的，所以 docker ps -a 里什么都不剩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it was started with --rm, so nothing is left in docker ps -a.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:49.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你笔记本上的 outputs 目录会留着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The outputs folder stays on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:54.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面的 trace 数据库存着你的 prompt 和输出，密钥已经脱敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its trace database holds your prompts and outputs, keys redacted;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.03,0:29:55.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用完了就把它删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}delete it when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:30:00.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker image rm，能腾出那 1.77 GB 里的大部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker image rm frees most of those 1.77 gigabytes;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,留下的是 base image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the base image stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.76,0:30:05.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后关掉存过你密钥的那个终端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then close the terminal that held your key,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.28,0:30:09.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,别让密钥进文件、commit 和 shell 历史记录，再留意你的用量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}keep it out of files, commits and your shell history, and watch your usage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.00,0:30:12.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Colab 里，删除运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In Colab, delete the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.41,0:30:14.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它拆掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and tear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.02,0:30:20.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是行动边界，现在填好了：预算和图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is the action boundary, filled in: budgets and the graph;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.30,0:30:23.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,schema、审计和保存时的审批\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}schemas, the audit and approval on save;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.07,0:30:26.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上下文包、胶囊和由宿主程序写的记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the packet, the capsule and host-written memory;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:28.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CartCheck 和重新校验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CartCheck and revalidation;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.25,0:30:30.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,窄工具和分开的计数器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}narrow tools and separate counters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.92,0:30:32.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型提议，在左边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model proposes, on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.22,0:30:36.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在右边，harness 决定；而在关键的地方，你也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the right, the harness decides, and where it matters, so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.12,0:30:40.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 最后有五个反思问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README ends with five reflection questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.32,0:30:42.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,挑一次你跑过的运行，回答这些问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pick one run you did, and answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:44.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:46.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,去掉 trace 之后，harness 还剩下什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What survives harness.without("trace")?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.69,0:30:49.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么检索到的上下文要作为数据进来？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does retrieved context arrive as data?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.67,0:30:51.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批准绑定的是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What is an approval bound to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.72,0:30:53.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一种状态能授权一个行动？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which state can authorize an action?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:56.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，一批通过的 fixture 运行能证明什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what does a passing fixture batch establish?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.88,0:31:00.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，试着答一答；答案在练习里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try them; answers are in the exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.58,0:31:08.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，第 8 讲会在 Google 的 Agent Platform 上微调模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, lecture 8 fine-tunes models on Google's Agent Platform,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:09.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它以前叫 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}formerly Vertex AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.03,0:31:12.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 9 讲用 pytest 测试代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lecture 9 tests code with pytest;
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.92,0:31:17.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的 281 个测试用的是 unittest，是很好的范例\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}these 281 tests use unittest, and are a good model.
